     "steps": [
      "Vertically T_thread cos(theta) = mg and horizontally T_thread sin(theta) = m omega^2 r, so tan(theta) = omega^2 r / g.",
      "Rearrange: omega^2 = g tan(theta) / r, with r = 21 cm = 0.21 m.",
      "omega^2 = 9.81 x tan(22 degrees) / 0.21 = 9.81 x 0.404 / 0.21 = 18.9 rad^2 s^-2, so omega = 4.34 rad s^-1.",
      "Period T = 2 pi / omega = 6.283 / 4.344 = 1.446 s.",
      "So the time for one revolution is 1.4 s (2 s.f.)."
     ],
