      "p = sqrt((4.67 x 10^-20)^2 + (1.43 x 10^-20)^2) = 4.9 x 10^-20 N s, about 5 x 10^-20 N s.",
      "tan(theta) = 1.43 / 4.67, so theta = 17 degrees, about 20 degrees to 1 significant figure."
